  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Reena Sharma vs State Of Up And 3 Others on 23 July, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:117414 Court No. - 5 Case :- Writ - A No. - 10512 of 2024 Petitioner :- Reena Sharma Respondent :- State of U.P. and others Counsel for Petitioner :- Deepak Maurya Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble J.J. Munir,J. 1.",
    "facts": "2. By the impugned order, the petitioner, who is a Food Safety Officer, has been transferred from Meerut to Agra. The petitioner assails the transfer order dated 30.06.2024 and submits that she is in the family way and it would imperil her life if she is forced to join at Agra, the station where she has been transferred to.",
    "arguments": "3. On instructions, the learned Standing Counsel submits that the respondents' stand is that the petitioner has been posted at Meerut for more than 8 years, and in the event she is in the family way, which makes her difficult to move station, she can apply for maternity leave."
  },
